  "content": "<p data-pid=\"Diz4Z56K\">让 agent 用各种方法去尝试做一件事情，反复踩坑，然后把经验总结下来。我最近在做百合动画分析，需要从互联网上的各种犄角旮旯的地方寻找动画字幕来做文本分析，经常遇到 subagent 在原地打转的情况，所以就做了一个用来找动画字幕的 skill：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2fd658b022708e99d339464eac7e52c5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"781\" data-rawheight=\"833\" data-original-token=\"v2-2fd658b022708e99d339464eac7e52c5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"781\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2fd658b022708e99d339464eac7e52c5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;781&#39; height=&#39;833&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"781\" data-rawheight=\"833\" data-original-token=\"v2-2fd658b022708e99d339464eac7e52c5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"781\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2fd658b022708e99d339464eac7e52c5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2fd658b022708e99d339464eac7e52c5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dafcc6399c5fd99e85c4d4bce05ba247_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"780\" data-rawheight=\"860\" data-original-token=\"v2-dafcc6399c5fd99e85c4d4bce05ba247\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"780\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-dafcc6399c5fd99e85c4d4bce05ba247_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;780&#39; height=&#39;860&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"780\" data-rawheight=\"860\" data-original-token=\"v2-dafcc6399c5fd99e85c4d4bce05ba247\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"780\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-dafcc6399c5fd99e85c4d4bce05ba247_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dafcc6399c5fd99e85c4d4bce05ba247_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-250c5dc134393c654d165c99c1de03d0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"773\" data-rawheight=\"980\" data-original-token=\"v2-250c5dc134393c654d165c99c1de03d0\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"773\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-250c5dc134393c654d165c99c1de03d0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;773&#39; height=&#39;980&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"773\" data-rawheight=\"980\" data-original-token=\"v2-250c5dc134393c654d165c99c1de03d0\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"773\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-250c5dc134393c654d165c99c1de03d0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-250c5dc134393c654d165c99c1de03d0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"9uckFC6I\">然后就搞定了。</p><p data-pid=\"qVfxSN8-\">同理，因为几个动漫数据库会反爬，害我拿不到百合标签，所以也做了一个通过浏览器检索标签的 skill：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0d55b3b6a92b0e9ce7c890e2a35a9ca5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"795\" data-rawheight=\"873\" data-original-token=\"v2-0d55b3b6a92b0e9ce7c890e2a35a9ca5\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"795\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0d55b3b6a92b0e9ce7c890e2a35a9ca5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;795&#39; height=&#39;873&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"795\" data-rawheight=\"873\" d